div.p:
Reaffirming the principles embodied in that
                    Resolution as an acceptable and honorable basis for a settlement of the question
                    of the repatriation of prisoners of war;

Calls upon the Communists to avert further bloodshed
                    by accepting forthwith the resolution of December 3, 1952, or otherwise agreeing
                    to an armistice based on the principles of the United Nations;
